<title>BRAZIL: Valepar ups Brazil CVRD stake slightly.</title>
<headline>Valepar ups Brazil CVRD stake slightly.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Valepar consortium led by steelmaker CSN increased its stake in mining group CVRD to 41.73 percent of voting shares, giving it 26.85 percent of the firm's total capital, officials said.</p>
<p>The official of the Rio de Janeiro bolsa said the consortium paid 3.338 billion reais for 104.3 shares.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Rio newsroom 55-21-5074151))</p>
